Subject: [PATCH 2046/3799] soh: rename func_80AB6D08 ->
 EnNiw_FlutterAfterRelease

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the post-release state: flaps back to 4 y-velocity whenever it lands and counts down the stay timer; whether this is gliding or hovering is not settled by the code, so the name records the flap-and-descend loop
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c
index 63782e5af..8e83b3014 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c
